cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CloneGuard in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CloneGuard"
abstract: >-
  CloneGuard raises the cost of prompt injection attacks against AI coding
  agents through multi-tier detection: regex pattern matching (191 patterns,
  24 categories), a fine-tuned MiniLM-L6-v2 ONNX classifier (CV F1=95.80%),
  and runtime hook integration for Claude Code, with planned support for
  Gemini CLI, Cursor, Windsurf, and VS Code Copilot.
authors:
  - alias: "prodnull"
url: "https://github.com/prodnull/cloneguard"
repository-code: "https://github.com/prodnull/cloneguard"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-03-09"
keywords:
  - prompt-injection
  - ai-security
  - llm-security
  - coding-agent
  - defense-in-depth
  - onnx
  - mcp-gateway
